@startuml
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #555555
}

state "Stopped\nwatering = false\nrestart_blocked = false" as Stopped
state "Running\nwatering = true\nrestart_blocked = false" as Running
state "Running, restart blocked\nwatering = true\nrestart_blocked = true" as RunBlocked
state "Stopped, restart blocked\nwatering = false\nrestart_blocked = true" as StopBlocked

[*] --> Stopped
Stopped --> Running : healthy START on,\nhealthy STOP released
Stopped --> StopBlocked : any input fault
Running --> Stopped : healthy STOP pressed
Running --> RunBlocked : START fault,\nhealthy STOP released
Running --> StopBlocked : STOP fault, or STOP\npressed during START fault
RunBlocked --> Running : both healthy,\nSTART off, STOP released
RunBlocked --> Stopped : healthy STOP pressed,\nhealthy START off
RunBlocked --> StopBlocked : STOP fault, or STOP pressed\nwhile START on or faulted
StopBlocked --> Stopped : both healthy, START off
@enduml
